sub completion | Generate completion script
sub delete | delete and teardown Colima
sub help | Help about any command
sub kubernetes | manage Kubernetes cluster
sub list | list instances
sub model | manage AI models (requires docker runtime and krunkit VM typ
sub nerdctl | run nerdctl (requires containerd runtime)
sub prune | prune cached downloaded assets
sub restart | restart Colima
sub ssh | SSH into the VM
sub ssh-config | show SSH connection config
sub start | start Colima
sub status | show the status of Colima
sub stop | stop Colima
sub template | edit the template for default configurations
sub update | update the container runtime
sub version | print the version of Colima
flag -h --help | help for colima
flag -p --profile arg=none | profile name, for multiple instances (default "default")
flag -v --verbose | enable verbose log
flag --version | version for colima
flag --very-verbose | enable more verbose log
